msgid ""
"The June newsletter has some great new Quarkus articles. Learn how Banco do "
"Brazil used Quarkus to create a new system to integrate with other financial "
"institutions that participate in the Brazilian Open Banking environment. Get "
"technical on how to configure Podman for Quarkus Dev Services and "
"Testcontainers on Linux in an article by Michal Jurč. Gary A. Stafford "
"teaches about Developing, testing, building, and deploying Native Quarkus-"
"based Java microservices to Kubernetes on AWS, using GitOps. Daniel Oh has "
"shares some great tips in \"Build a Quarkus reactive application using "
"Kubernetes Secrets\". F. Marchioni wrote a great tutorial on \"Creating "
"Quarkus applications using IntelliJ IDEA\". Roudranil Roy discusses his "
"pursuit of developer KNative joy in his \"Quarkus & KNative— An Attempt\" "
"article."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You will also see the lastest Quarkus Insights episodes, top tweets and "
"upcoming Quarkus attended events."
msgstr ""

msgid "Check out https://quarkus.io/newsletter/21/[Newsletter #21]!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Want to get newsletters in your inbox? https://quarkus.io/newsletter[Sign up "
"for the newsletter] using the on page form."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We've also included the list of the newest found online stories. Give it a "
"read and if you feel something is missing or have an article coming out for "
"future Quarkus Newsletter install the https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"url2quarkuspub[bookmarklet] on your laptop and phone to easily submit a "
"story. If you prefer the manual way please https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkusio.github.io/issues[open an issue] with a short description and a url."
""
msgstr ""
